sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent / Client
    participant Host as Host Application<br/>(Praxis Proxy)
    participant PPE as PPE PolicyEngine<br/>(in-process)
    participant IdResolver as Identity Resolver<br/>(JWT / API-Key)
    participant IdP as IdP JWKS Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant PDP as PDP Evaluator<br/>(Cedar/CEL/OPA in-process)
    participant Deleg as Delegation Plugin<br/>(OAuth RFC 8693)
    participant IdPToken as IdP Token Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Session as Session Manager
    participant ValkeyDB as Valkey<br/>6379/TCP Optional TLS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Agent,ValkeyDB: Flow 1: Tool Call Policy Enforcement
        Agent->>Host: Tool call request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key
        Host->>PPE: invoke(operation, context)<br/>Rust API (in-process)

        rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
            Note over PPE,IdP: Phase: Identity Resolution
            PPE->>IdResolver: resolve_identity(credentials)
            IdResolver->>IdP: GET /.well-known/jwks.json<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+ (rustls)
            IdP-->>IdResolver: JWKS key set
            IdResolver-->>PPE: Verified identity<br/>(subject, claims, roles)
        end

        rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
            Note over PPE,PDP: Phase: Authorization Decision
            PPE->>PDP: evaluate(policy, identity, operation)
            Note right of PDP: APL predicates compiled<br/>to Cedar/CEL/OPA
            PDP-->>PPE: Decision: Allow / Deny<br/>(cached if opt-in)
        end

        rect rgb(255, 240, 255)
            Note over PPE,IdPToken: Phase: Credential Delegation
            PPE->>Deleg: exchange(inbound_token, audience)
            Deleg->>IdPToken: POST /token (RFC 8693)<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+ (rustls)<br/>Auth: Client Credentials
            IdPToken-->>Deleg: Audience-scoped token
            Note right of Deleg: HMAC-SHA256 cache key<br/>Bounded moka cache
            Deleg-->>PPE: Delegated token (zeroized on drop)
        end

        rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
            Note over PPE,ValkeyDB: Phase: Session Taint Tracking
            PPE->>Session: update_taint(session_id, labels)
            Session->>ValkeyDB: SET session:{sha256_key}<br/>Redis protocol, Optional TLS
            ValkeyDB-->>Session: OK
            Session-->>PPE: Taint recorded
        end

        PPE-->>Host: PolicyResult (allow/deny + assertions)
        Host-->>Agent: Response (with delegated credentials injected)
    end

    rect rgb(248, 248, 248)
        Note over PPE,ValkeyDB: Flow 2: Secret Resolution at Startup
        participant Vault as Vault KV v2<br/>8200/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

        PPE->>PPE: resolve_secrets(config)
        Note right of PPE: env provider: read env vars<br/>file provider: read local files
        PPE->>Vault: GET /v1/secret/data/{path}<br/>HTTPS/8200, TLS 1.2+ (rustls)<br/>Auth: K8s/AppRole Token
        Vault-->>PPE: Secret material
        Note right of PPE: Fail-fast if missing at startup<br/>Last-good on refresh failure<br/>Zeroized on drop
    end
